        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for libraw",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for libraw fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-20911: heap-based buffer overflow in `HuffTable::initval`(bsc#1261673).\n- CVE-2026-21413: heap-based buffer overflow in `lossless_jpeg_load_raw` (bsc#1261674).\n- CVE-2026-24660: heap-based buffer overflow in `x3f_load_huffman` (bsc#1261676).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
